abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for literature acquisition across research projects that share
  one portfolio: open-access PDF and full-text acquisition (Unpaywall, PubMed
  Central and preprint servers, chosen per project), residual routing to
  worklists for what cannot be fetched, citation walking (Semantic Scholar,
  OpenAlex and Crossref), a DuckDB portfolio index, JATS and PDF structured
  extraction including MathML-to-LaTeX conversion, and a scheduled runner for
  Linux and Windows.
